            "action_name": {
              "value": "Portents Of Doom"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(auditory, divination, emotion, fear, mental, occult)\n\nThe golgopo unleashes a wailing cry that heralds impending disaster. Each creature within 30 feet must attempt a 26 Will save. Golgopos and cyclopes are immune to this effect.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected and temporarily immune for 1 minute.\n- **Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Failure:** The creature is frightened 1.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature is frightened 2 and confused for 1 round."
            },
